@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统：订单创建与库存占用
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor "顾客" as Customer
boundary "Customer UI" as CustomerUI
participant "Cart" as Cart
participant "Order" as Order
participant "Identity and Access" as Auth
participant "Store and Menu" as Catalog
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Data Access" as DataAccess
database "Persistent Storage" as Storage
participant "Notification" as Notification
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

Customer -> CustomerUI : 确认单店购物车、最新价格与地址
CustomerUI -> Cart : 获取菜品、数量与总价
Cart --> CustomerUI : 结算内容
CustomerUI -> Order : 提交结算确认ID及收货信息
Order -> DataAccess : 查询结算确认ID对应订单
DataAccess -> Storage : 读取订单
Storage --> DataAccess : 查询结果
DataAccess --> Order : 已有订单或空

alt 相同结算确认已生成订单
  Order --> CustomerUI : 返回原订单，不再次占用库存
else 新的结算确认
  Order -> Auth : 核验顾客、地址及配送范围
  Auth --> Order : 核验结果
  Order -> Catalog : 核验店铺营业、菜品状态和最新价格
  Catalog --> Order : 最新商品和金额
  alt 地址、营业状态或价格确认无效
    Order --> CustomerUI : 说明原因并要求重新确认
  else 核验通过
    Order -> DataAccess : 开启下单事务
    DataAccess -> Storage : 建立事务
    Order -> Inventory : 原子占用所购菜品数量
    Inventory -> DataAccess : 在同一事务中条件更新数量并记录占用
    DataAccess -> Storage : 条件更新，暂不提交
    Storage --> DataAccess : 成功或库存不足
    DataAccess --> Inventory : 占用结果
    alt 最后一份已被其他订单占用
      Inventory --> Order : 库存不足，未扣减
      Order -> DataAccess : 回滚下单事务
      DataAccess -> Storage : 回滚
      Order --> CustomerUI : 付款前提示库存不足
    else 占用成功
      Inventory --> Order : 每种菜品的占用记录
      Order -> DataAccess : 在同一事务中保存订单、快照和结算确认ID
      DataAccess -> Storage : 写入待付款订单并提交事务
      Storage --> DataAccess : 保存成功
      DataAccess --> Order : 订单ID
      Order -> Notification : 通知顾客新订单
      Order -> Audit : 记录下单与库存占用
      Order --> CustomerUI : 返回待付款订单
    end
  end
end
@enduml
